# Mill — environment

Copy to `.env.local` (or set in your host) as needed.

| Variable | Required | Description |
|----------|----------|-------------|
| `ENGINE_BINARY_PATH` | No | Path to the Miller binary used as `transform-engine`. Used at `npm install` (copy into `bin/`) and at runtime by `/api/run` if set. If unset, the app uses `bin/transform-engine` after postinstall. |
| `MILL_ALLOWED_ORIGIN` | Yes in production | Exact origin allowed for CORS on `POST /api/run` (e.g. `https://mill.example.com`). Never use `*`. In development, localhost / 127.0.0.1 origins are accepted automatically. |

No database or external API keys are required for the default setup.
